dedb (0.0.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship a packaged default config; create it on first run.
  * Never crash on a missing or invalid config - fall back to defaults
    with a warning.
  * Harden `rm` and gate download_dir auto-creation to the temp dir.
  * Derive __version__ from the installed package metadata.

 -- Stuart Axon <stu.axon@gmail.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 22:28:00 +0100

